const sources=[['hours','授课学时'],['participants','课程人次'],['income','归属培训收入'],['qualifications','有效资质数'],['points','本期积分'],['assessment_score','上一已归档考核分']];
function ruleRow(c={key:'',label:'',source:'hours',factor:'1',weight:'0',target:'1',cap:''}){return `<div class="rule-row"><input data-r="key" aria-label="积分项编码" required pattern="[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,40}" placeholder="hours" value="${esc(c.key)}"><input data-r="label" aria-label="指标名称" required value="${esc(c.label)}" placeholder="授课贡献"><select data-r="source" aria-label="指标数据来源">${sources.map(([v,l])=>`<option value="${v}" ${v===c.source?'selected':''}>${l}</option>`).join('')}</select><input data-r="factor" aria-label="积分系数" type="number" min="0" step="0.0001" value="${esc(c.factor??1)}" required><input data-r="weight" aria-label="考核权重" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" value="${esc(c.weight??0)}" required><input data-r="target" aria-label="考核达标值" type="number" min="0.0001" step="0.0001" value="${esc(c.target??1)}" required><input data-r="cap" aria-label="积分上限" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="${esc(c.cap??'')}" placeholder="不限"><button type="button" class="btn text" data-action="rule-remove">移除</button></div>`}
async function ruleForm(id){const all=(await api('/rules')).items,x=all.find(x=>x.id===id);const options=periods.filter(p=>p.state==='OPEN').map(p=>[p.id,p.name]);if(!options.length)throw Error('请先创建开放的考核周期');
 formModal(id?'复制规则形成新版本':'新建规则版本',field('kind','规则类型','select',x?.kind||'points',{options:[['points','教师积分'],['assessment','三级考核']]})+field('name','规则名称','text',x?x.name+'（新版本）':'')+field('period_id','适用周期','select',periodId||x?.period_id||options[0][0],{options,full:true})+`<div class="form-field full"><label>指标配置 <b>*</b></label><div class="rule-row rule-labels"><span>项编码</span><span>指标名称</span><span>数据来源</span><span>积分系数</span><span>考核权重</span><span>考核达标值</span><span>积分上限</span></div><div id="rule-rows">${(x?.config.components||[{key:'hours',label:'授课贡献',source:'hours',factor:2,weight:100,target:96}]).map(ruleRow).join('')}</div><div class="mt12">${act('增加指标','rule-add','','sm','plus')}</div><p class="hint">积分 = 原始值 × 系数（可设上限）；考核 = 达标比例 × 权重，权重总和必须为 100。正式指标及口径由学校确认。</p></div>`+reasonFields(),async(v,f)=>{const components=$$('.rule-row',$('#rule-rows')).map(row=>Object.fromEntries($$('[data-r]',row).map(el=>[el.dataset.r,el.dataset.r==='cap'?(el.value||null):el.value])));v.config={components};await api('/rules',{method:'POST',body:v});await saved('已创建新规则草稿，请试算确认后启用')},{wide:true,submit:'保存规则草稿'})}
async function showRule(id){const x=(await api('/rules')).items.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!x)throw Error('规则不存在');modalContext=x;modal('规则版本 · '+x.name,`<div class="between"><div><p class="small muted">${esc(periodName(x.period_id))} · v${x.version_no}</p><p class="mt8">${badge(x.state)}</p></div><span class="mono">${esc(x.fingerprint.slice(0,20))}…</span></div>${table(['指标','数据来源','系数','权重','达标值','上限'],x.config.components.map(c=>[esc(c.label),esc(sources.find(s=>s[0]===c.source)?.[1]),c.factor,c.weight,c.target,c.cap??'—']))}<div id="trial-result" class="mt16"></div>${note('启用新规则不会自动重写任何历史结果。已确认积分需先授权解锁；已归档结果保持冻结。')}`,act('关闭','close')+act('选择教师试算','trial',id)+act(x.state==='ACTIVE'?'停用规则':'启用规则','rule-action',(x.state==='ACTIVE'?'deactivate':'activate')+'|'+id,'primary'),true)}
async function trial(id){formModal('选择样本教师试算',`<div class="form-field full"><label>选择样本（最多 20 名）</label><input id="calc-search" placeholder="输入姓名或工号"><button type="button" class="btn mt8" data-action="calc-search">检索</button><div id="calc-people" class="checkbox-list mt12">${teachers.slice(0,20).map(t=>`<label><input type="checkbox" name="person" value="${t.id}">${esc(t.name)} · ${esc(t.staff_no)}</label>`).join('')}</div></div>`,async(v,f)=>{const ids=$$('input[name=person]:checked',f).map(x=>x.value);if(!ids.length||ids.length>20)throw Error('请选择 1～20 名教师');const result=await api('/rules/'+id+'/trial',{method:'POST',body:{teacher_ids:ids}});await showRule(id);$('#trial-result').innerHTML=`<h3>本次试算结果（未写业务台账）</h3>${table(['教师','试算合计','各项公式'],result.items.map(x=>[esc(teacherName(x.teacher_id)),number(x.total,2),x.detail.map(i=>`<div class="small">${esc(i.label)}：${esc(i.formula)} = ${esc(i.score)}</div>`).join('')]))}`},{wide:true,submit:'执行样本试算'})}
